repository-code: "https://github.com/Htbibalan/arcitc_lighthouse"
url: "https://github.com/Htbibalan/arcitc_lighthouse"

abstract: >
  Lighthouse is a desktop application for local control and scheduling
  of Philips Hue lighting in configurable experimental environments.
  It supports organization of lights into rooms, boxes, cages,
  compartments, and other spaces, together with manual light control
  and scheduled lighting protocols.